<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Family Dollar, Dollar General.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Family Dollar, Dollar General.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Dollar General Corp and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said it initiated coverage of Family Dollar Stores Inc as market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
